The architecture this library implements (a model, an update function, a view, and effects and
long-lived subscriptions requested by the update function) follows the Elm Architecture as
realised for F# by Fable.Elmish (https://github.com/elmish/elmish), Copyright (c) Eugene Tolmachev
and contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Any file in this repository that
descends from that code carries its copyright line beside this project's.

The kernel's fixed-capacity ring and keyed diff, and their F* models, are adapted from the ring buffer,
the subscription diff and the proved ring models of the ToolUp Analytics open-source SDK, toolup-forge
(https://github.com/ToolUp-Analytics/toolup-forge), Copyright (c) Andrew J. Willshire / ToolUp
Analytics Ltd (UK), itself derived from Fable.Elmish, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Any file in this repository that descends from that code carries both copyright lines beside this
project's.

